  "releaseNotes": "## v1.24.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v1.23.0:\n\n- Say which non-finite value this is with a switch rather than a nest ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Stop a schema naming something the target language already has ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Write a default so that reading it back gives what was written ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Give the C++ generator its own listing on NuGet ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))",
